{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_041_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7f3ae09be7f07f4c453b67ea48715d1ce0fb939742f4cbdd817478901e29cfc6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0dd700a82324509f0958603c6f19ab14042e9bd5fd43358b225d4b7faa1da06",
      "text": "哇啊……！看起来好好吃的巧克力！\n毕竟现在是情人节的时节呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22d7a9c0cfebfe6e25dc8167d718bc7847955bcfc3bac7d68bea9f036880f8ea",
      "text": "……诶，是给我的吗！？非常感谢，\n●●●●プロデューサー！我超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8350f01018f21fd5b6f65b35eb2ed50cff7c7213412706ebeacae5a600e0679",
      "text": "好——，吃了这盒巧克力，\n训练和工作我都要加倍努力啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:614aeb8d31d57db56a5d1b2a6acbea7b8db744fa58aa205c72e3d44af6b2332b",
      "text": "制作人，请好好看着我哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10f93ab3d969eb73fe3847440f3ab9913fb4921e4f4740ec49d35f48b527c8d1",
      "text": "我一定会成为配得上这盒巧克力的、\n帅气的男性偶像给您看的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:406e2299a6a9d5a6ad0a5c49317ded0086b0bf8ad0ccd2b8489b082ea11cc9b3",
      "text": "哇哇，这盒情人节巧克力是给我的吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000015:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f43603f116846bb5a7663e50f15c778e63697b6a72368cab42f6a58c9b64de55",
      "text": "是的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bb7b6e608e2665cce3e5b3b4e36c8d834448fd62c8024252dd368e8a7b1c7a9",
      "text": "呜呜，以前在学校里总是被别人缠着要巧克力，\n作为女性偶像时也一直是送巧克力的那一方，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37a26d8b8a94921d5d0ceb96d736728d3725d40a70c9008698fb345f11c5518a",
      "text": "如今不仅能收到粉丝送的，居然还能从制作人\n这里收到巧克力……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67b56deff8c129f21b7eafd001a22af60f567df28693298bcbc20f3c9bce0ad6",
      "text": "太感动了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dcd50223c82a1a7f23c1db1aa71b0ff1c1999fb7b92e05b86a1179e7716def8",
      "text": "你能这么开心，我也很高兴哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:359a155a153d8dcc0885e052622e20a72093f338d4e92f001826864acae409b9",
      "text": "以后每年我都会送你巧克力的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ba3a62510d231506e805fda61d85c90249b8c5cc16e5d5acfd0f2ce7746ddc6",
      "text": "嗯，我真的超级开心的！\n今天的事我绝不会忘记。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd43f7c75cc9e171c253072f3970594dacfdb76e69e128d1240512c519b17d4",
      "text": "既然如此，我也会一直做那个能让制作人\n想要送巧克力的偶像的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:314dd411cd414966a23add918e0fca7206640ad0e2d98ada8a13a29226b99c79",
      "text": "这盒巧克力，我会好好珍惜着吃完的。\n真的非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_041_22:5_01_041_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92f3e89966947db4f186313c23bb7287daa7a2a18c02e848667474759f910b6a",
      "text": "白色情人节的回礼，我会卯足干劲准备好的。\n敬请期待哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
